<title>UK: Tay Homes annual pre-tax profits slide.</title>
<headline>Tay Homes annual pre-tax profits slide.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		2.4		    vs 15.9</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 7.0		    vs 7.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     1.09		   vs 7.06</p>
<p> Turnover		   109.6		  vs 117.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Home builder Tay Homes Plc said that current sales are 35 percent higher than at this time last year and that the indications for the current year are much more positive.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 4.0		    vs 9.5</p>
<p> Pay date		   Nov 25</p>
<p>Div registration date  Oct 22</p>
<p>--London newsroom - +44 171 542 4019</p>
